---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<div class="d-md-flex flex-md-equal w-100 my-md-3 ps-md-3">
  <div
    class="bg-body-tertiary me-md-3 pt-3 px-3 pt-md-5 px-md-5 text-center overflow-hidden"
  >
    <div class="my-3 p-3">
      <h2 class="display-5">论文-学生科研</h2>
      <p class="lead">国庆节期间，完成了第一篇教育学论文综述。</p>
      <p class="lead">
        <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22996542" target="_blank"
          ><u>查看（10.5281/zenodo.22996543）</u>
          <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
    <img
      src="/images/research.webp"
      alt="文献综述"
      class="card-image shadow-sm mx-auto"
    />
  </div>
  <div
    class="text-bg-primary me-md-3 pt-3 px-3 pt-md-5 px-md-5 text-center overflow-hidden"
  >
    <div class="my-3 py-3">
      <h2 class="display-5">教资准备</h2>
      <p class="lead">护士固然但不成了，但教师是我的第二梦想。</p>
    </div>
    <img
      src="/images/teaching.webp"
      alt="教资准备"
      class="card-image shadow-sm mx-auto"
    />
  </div>
</div>
